<title>LATVIA: LATVIA-C.BANK WARNS ABOUT COUNTERFEIT BANKNOTES.</title>
<headline>LATVIA-C.BANK WARNS ABOUT COUNTERFEIT BANKNOTES.</headline>
<dateline>RIGA 1997-05-22</dateline>
<text>
<p>The central bank on Thursday said that several crude counterfeit 50 and 100 lat banknotes have recently been discovered and urged money users to avoid unpleasant surprises by double checking.</p>
<p>&quot;The number of counterfeit banknotes against the total amount of notes in circulation is extremely small and the falsification is usually easily detectable,&quot; the bank said in a statement.</p>
<p>It said that the notes had been photo-copied.</p>
<p>-- Riga Newsroom, +371 721 5240</p>
</text>
